stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> RawObserved
    RawObserved --> SourceManifested
    SourceManifested --> Canonicalized
    Canonicalized --> MemoryDraft
    MemoryDraft --> MachineGenerated
    MachineGenerated --> NeedsHumanReview
    MachineGenerated --> Active
    NeedsHumanReview --> Active: approved
    NeedsHumanReview --> Rejected: rejected
    Active --> Projected
    Projected --> Retrieved
    Retrieved --> Reinforced: useful feedback
    Retrieved --> Penalized: bad feedback
    Reinforced --> Active
    Penalized --> Active
    Active --> Superseded: newer evidence
    Active --> Dormant: low activation/stale
    Dormant --> Active: recalled/revalidated
    Superseded --> Retired
    Rejected --> Retired
    Retired --> [*]
